ther of Obed by Ruth. Obed became the father of Jesse."},{"verse":6,"text":"Jesse became the father of King David. David the king became the father of Solomon by her who had been Uriah’s wife."},{"verse":7,"text":"Solomon became the father of Rehoboam. Rehoboam became the father of Abijah. Abijah became the father of Asa."},{"verse":8,"text":"Asa became the father of Jehoshaphat. Jehoshaphat became the father of Joram. Joram became the father of Uzziah."},{"verse":9,"text":"Uzziah became the father of Jotham. Jotham became the father of Ahaz. Ahaz became the father of Hezekiah."},{"verse":10,"text":"Hezekiah became the father of Manasseh. Manasseh became the father of Amon. Amon became the father of Josiah."},{"verse":11,"text":"Josiah became the father of Jechoniah and his brothers at the time of the exile to Babylon."},{"verse":12,"text":"After the exile to Babylon, Jechoniah became the father of Shealtiel. Shealtiel became the father of Zerubbabel."},{"verse":13,"text":"Zerubbabel became the father of Abiud. Abiud became the father of Eliakim. Eliakim became the father of Azor."},{"verse":14,"text":"Azor became the father of Zadok. Zadok became the father of Achim. Achim became the father of Eliud."},{"verse":15,"text":"Eliud became the father of Eleazar. Eleazar became the father of Matthan. Matthan became the father of Jacob."},{"verse":16,"text":"Jacob became the father of Joseph, the husband of Mary, from whom was born Jesus, who is called Christ."},{"verse":17,"text":"So all the generations from Abraham to David are fourteen generations; from David to the exile to Babylon fourteen generations; and from the carrying away to Babylon to the Christ, fourteen generations."},{"verse":18,"text":"Now the birth of Jesus Christ was like this: After his mother, Mary, was engaged to Joseph, before they came together, she was found pregnant by the Holy Spirit."},{"verse":19,"text":"Joseph, her husband, being a righteous man, and not willing to make her a public example, intended to put her away secretly."},{"verse":20,"text":"But when he thought about these things, behold, an angel of the Lord appeared to him in a dream, saying, “Joseph, son of David, don’t be afraid to take to yourself Mary as your wife, for that which is conceived in her is of the Holy Spirit."},{"verse":21,"text":"She shall give birth to a son. You shall name him Jesus, for it is he who shall save his people from their sins.”"},{"verse":22,"text":"Now all this has happened that it might be fulfilled which was spoken by the Lord through the prophet, saying,"},{"verse":23,"text":"“Behold, the virgin shall be with child, and shall give birth to a son. They shall call his name Immanuel,” which is, being interpreted, “God with us.”"},{"verse":24,"text":"Joseph arose from his sleep, and did as the angel of the Lord commanded him, and took his wife to himself;"},{"verse":25,"text":"and didn’t know her sexually until she had given birth to her firstborn son. He named him Jesus."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]},{"id":"matthew_5","bookSlug":"matthew","chapter":5,"reference":"Matthew 5","title":"Blessed Are the Gentle, Pure & Peacemakers","topics":["blessing","peace","mercy","humility","light","comfort","kingdom","八福","和平"],"snippet":{"en":"“Blessed are the poor in spirit, for theirs is the Kingdom of Heaven.”","zh":"「虛心的人有福了！因為天國是他們的。」","zh-CN":"「虚心的人有福了！因为天国是他们的。」"},"tokens":{"blessed":7,"are":10,"the":17,"gentle":2,"pure":2,"peacemakers":2,"blessing":1,"peace":1,"mercy":2,"humility":1,"light":2,"comfort":1,"kingdom":2,"八福":2,"和平":2,"matthew":3,"poor":1,"in":2,"spirit":1,"for":8,"theirs":1,"is":1,"of":6,"heaven":1,"those":1,"who":1,"mourn":1,"they":7,"shall":5,"be":3,"comforted":1,"inherit":1,"earth":1,"merciful":1,"obtain":1,"heart":1,"see":1,"god":2,"called":1,"children":1,"you":2,"world":1,"city":1,"located":1,"on":3,"hill":1,"can":2,"hidden":1,"馬太福音":1,"虛心的人有福了":1,"因為天國是他們的":1,"哀慟的人有福了":1,"因為他們必得安慰":1,"溫柔的人有福了":1,"因為他們必承受地土":1,"憐恤人的人有福了":1,"因為他們必蒙憐恤":1,"清心的